 "rules": [
  "Grids are rows of tiles, north row first. A piece is size[0] x size[1] cells of 8 x 8 tiles.",
  "Edges are wall except doorways, which sit in pairs at tiles 3 and 4 of a cell edge, so any two pieces join.",
  "rotate: the generator may turn the piece by 90, 180 or 270 degrees and mirror it (markers and opensFrom turn with it).",
  "weight: how often the generator picks it among pieces that fit. max: at most this many in one level.",
  "Corridor and junction pieces are never more than two tiles wide (no 3 x 3 open square). The checker enforces it."
 ],
